    "data_quality_note_en": "Listed status means a site is present in the project dataset, not independently field-verified as operational. One record (FSD) has no coordinates. Al Jallab Rest Area and Clover Mall have near-identical source coordinates despite different administrative locations, so the source values are preserved and flagged for verification rather than silently corrected."
